---
manual: art.transform
lines: [1857, 1860]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: E10
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 300, height: 300 do
  fill red
  nostroke
  rotate 90
  rect 100, 100, 60, 20
end
----------- test code
# The default is :corner. Turned 90 degrees about its corner (100, 100) the 60x20 bar
# stands on end, above or below the corner depending on the direction of turn.
red = ->(x, y) { pixel_at(x, y).first(3) == [255, 0, 0] }

refute red.(130, 110), "the bar has turned away from where it was drawn"
refute red.(130, 85), "it did not turn about its centre"
assert red.(90, 130) || red.(110, 70), "it turned about its corner (100, 100)"
